"] "\n" [:option {:value "255030"} "Kayak Singles, 10,000 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "255031"} "Kayak Doubles, 1,000 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "255037"} "Kayak Doubles, 10,000 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "255039"} "Canadian Singles, 1,000 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "255041"} "Canadian Singles, 10,000 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "255045"} "Canadian Doubles, 10,000 metres, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "255046"} "Kayak Singles, 500 metres, Women"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "255017"} "1936"] "\n" [:option {:value "255074"} "1952"] "\n" [:option {:value "255107"} "1956"] "\n" [:option {:value "255203"} "1960"] "\n" [:option {:value "255270"} "1964"] "\n" [:option {:value "255334"} "1968"] "\n" [:option {:value "255399"} "1972"] "\n" [:option {:value "255545"} "1976"] "\n" [:option {:value "255657"} "1980"] "\n" [:option {:value "255763"} "1984"] "\n" [:option {:value "255886"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "256022"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "256152"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "256265"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "256382"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "258809"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "307107"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "353532"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "19016188"} "2020"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/172"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Canadian Doubles, 1,000 metres, Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "12 August 1948 — 19:20"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/223"} "Henley Royal Regatta Course, Henley-on-Thames"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/255043"} "16 from 8 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Final only."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Due to World War II, there had been no recent Canoe Sprint World Championships, which, at the time, was the best predictor of Olympic success in the sport. Despite the time that had passed, however, one of the reigning Olympic champions, " [:a {:href "/athletes/10838"} "Jan Brzák-Felix"] " of Czechoslovakia, returned to defend his crown at the 1948 Games, bringing with him a new partner, " [:a {:href "/athletes/10870"} "Bohumil Kudrna"] ". In addition to his " [:a {:href "/results/255017"} "Olympic victory"] ", Brzák-Felix had also won the C-2 10,000 and taken silver in the C-2 1,000 at the 1938 ICF Canoe Sprint World Championships. Sweden’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/10769"} "Gunnar Johansson"] ", meanwhile, won the K-2 10,000 and came in third at the K-4 1,000 at that tournament, and was partnered with " [:a {:href "/athletes/10810"} "Werner Wettersten"] " in London. " [:a {:href "/athletes/11122"} "Steve Lysak"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/11123"} "Steve Macknowski"] " of the United States, winners of the " [:a {:href "/results/255045"} "C-2 10,000"] " the previous day, also took part in this event."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Brzák-Felix and Kudrna were the favorites in 1948 and, as the race neared its conclusion, it became a drive to the finish between the Czechoslovakians and the Americans, with the former taking gold with only about a second to spare. The French duo of " [:a {:href "/athletes/9624"} "Georges Dransart"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/9631"} "Georges Gandil"] ", who had been bronze medalists in the C-2 10,000 the day before, came in seven seconds later, but still far ahead of the rest of the field, for their second third-place finish of the tournament."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [